          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "احتفل (iḥtafala) is built on the native Arabic root ḥ-f-l, \"to gather, to fill\" (Lane). Iḥtafala is Form VIII, \"to gather for an occasion\", to celebrate."
