              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تزوج (tazawwaja) is built on the root z-w-j, \"one of a pair, a mate\" (Lane). Tazawwaja is Form V, \"to take a mate\", built from zawj, which is usually traced through Aramaic to Greek zeugos, \"yoke, pair\" (EtymDB)."
